@startuml User_Journey_Writing_Practice
!theme blueprint
title Cramer CMS - Writing Practice Journey\n(Complete Writing Test Cycle)

skinparam {
    BackgroundColor #1a1a2e
    TitleFontColor #ffffff
    TitleFontSize 18
    DefaultFontColor #e8e8e8
    ArrowColor #64b5f6
    NoteBackgroundColor #424242
    NoteFontColor #ffffff
    ActivityBackgroundColor #37474f
    ActivityBorderColor #78909c
}

|#2c3e50|Goal Setting|
start
:User wants to improve IELTS Writing;
note right
  **User Context:**
  - Current level: ~Band 5.5
  - Target: Band 7.0
  - Exam in 2 months
  - Struggles with Task 2
end note

:Has Cramerich subscription;
:3 AI gradings remaining this month;

|#34495e|Test Selection|
:Navigates to Courses;
:Selects "Cambridge 17";
:Clicks "Writing";
:Sees Task 1 (chart) and Task 2 (essay);

:Clicks "Bat dau bai thi";
:Sees grading quota info:
"Con 3 luot cham diem AI";

|#9b59b6|Task 1: Report Writing|
:Timer starts (60 minutes total);
:Reads Task 1 prompt;
note right
  **Task 1 Prompt:**
  "The chart shows the percentage
  of households with internet
  access from 2000-2020..."
end note

:Studies the chart/graph;
:Plans response structure:
- Introduction
- Overview
- Body paragraph 1
- Body paragraph 2;

:Writes 180 words (target: 150+);
:Sees live word count;
:Proofreads quickly;

|#3498db|Task 2: Essay Writing|
:Clicks "Task 2" tab;
:Reads essay prompt;
note right
  **Task 2 Prompt:**
  "Some people think that
  all university students should
  study whatever they like..."
end note

:Spends 40 minutes on Task 2;
:Writes 290 words (target: 250+);
:Structures essay:
- Introduction + thesis
- Body 1 (agree points)
- Body 2 (disagree points)
- Conclusion;

|#f39c12|Submission|
:Reviews both tasks;
:Clicks "Nop bai";
:Sees confirmation:
"Ban co chac muon nop bai?
AI se cham diem bai viet cua ban.";
:Confirms submission;

|#e74c3c|AI Grading (Behind Scenes)|
:Shows loading animation;
note right
  **Processing:**
  - Essay sent to DeepSeek API
  - ~15-30 seconds per task
  - Detailed analysis generated
end note

:Polling every 3 seconds;
:Task 1 graded...;
:Task 2 graded...;
:Both complete!;

|#27ae60|Results - Task 1|
:Redirects to Writing Review page;
:Sees Task 1 scores:
- Overall: **6.5**
- Task Achievement: 7.0
- Coherence: 6.5
- Lexical Resource: 6.0
- Grammar: 6.5;

:Expands feedback section;
note right
  **AI Feedback Highlights:**
  "Good overview but lacks
  specific data points.
  Consider including more
  numbers from the chart."
end note

:Sees error highlights:
- 2 grammar errors (red)
- 3 vocabulary suggestions (purple)
- 1 coherence issue (green);

|#1abc9c|Results - Task 2|
:Switches to Task 2 tab;
:Sees Task 2 scores:
- Overall: **6.0**
- Task Response: 6.0
- Coherence: 6.5
- Lexical Resource: 5.5
- Grammar: 6.0;

:Reads detailed feedback;
note right
  **Key Improvement Areas:**
  1. "Thesis could be clearer"
  2. "Vocabulary is repetitive"
  3. "Need stronger conclusion"
end note

:Views sample Band 7 essay;
:Compares with own writing;

|#9b59b6|Learning & Improvement|
:Identifies weak areas:
- Vocabulary variety
- Data inclusion (Task 1);

:Saves vocabulary from feedback;
:Notes common mistakes;

:Decides to practice again;
:2 AI gradings remaining;

if (Practice again?) then (yes)
  :Selects different test;
  :Focuses on weak areas;
else (no)
  :Reviews progress on Dashboard;
  :Plans next practice session;
endif

stop

legend right
  **Writing Journey Metrics:**
  |= Phase |= Time |
  | Test Selection | 1-2 min |
  | Task 1 Writing | 15-20 min |
  | Task 2 Writing | 35-40 min |
  | AI Grading | 30-60 sec |
  | Review & Learn | 10-15 min |
  | **Total** | **~70 min** |
endlegend

@enduml
